      "question": "Còn so với năm trước theo từng tháng thì sao?",
      "status": "executed",
      "sql": "WITH monthly AS (\n  SELECT \n    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM s.date) AS year,\n    EXTRACT(MONTH FROM s.date) AS month,\n    SUM(s.revenue) - SUM(s.cogs) AS gross_profit\n  FROM commerce.sales AS s\n  WHERE s.date >= CAST($1 AS DATE) AND s.date < CAST($2 AS DATE)\n  GROUP BY 1, 2\n)\nSELECT \n  m24.month AS month,\n  m24.gross_profit AS gross_profit_2024,\n  m23.gross_profit AS gross_profit_2023,\n  m24.gross_profit - m23.gross_profit AS difference\nFROM monthly AS m24\nLEFT JOIN monthly AS m23 ON m24.month = m23.month AND m23.year = 2023\nWHERE m24.year = 2024\nORDER BY m24.month ASC\nLIMIT 12",
